Package: tlosint-ghunt
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, python3
Description: OSINT tool for Google accounts and services
 GHunt extracts information from Google accounts, documents, photos and
 other services from an email address or a Gaia ID.
 .
 GHunt requires Google account cookies before it can do anything. Run
 "ghunt login" once as the user who will run it; credentials are stored in
 ~/.malfrats/ghunt. This package deliberately does not attempt to provision
 them at install time -- they are per-user and cannot be obtained unattended.
 .
 Ships a self-contained virtualenv under /opt/tracelabs/ghunt so its
 dependency pins cannot collide with other OSINT tools on the system. It
 pins pillow<11 where maigret resolves pillow 12, so the two genuinely
 cannot share an interpreter.
